# Phase 6 (MCHAN DMA) — cho co gioi han va phep thu nguoc

Khong co toolchain RISC-V tren may nay nen KHONG build duoc cho PULP.
Logic cua phase6_dma() duoc trich nguyen van ra 08_phase6_harness.c va chay
tren host voi stub DMA. Day la kiem chung LOGIC, khong phai kiem chung RTL.

## Hai thay doi
1. Thay plp_dma_wait() bang demo_dma_wait() poll co gioi han.
   plp_dma_wait (mchan_v7.h:414-419) la vong while khong gioi han, than vong la
   eu_evt_maskWaitAndClr -- core NGU cho su kien DMA. DMA khong bao xong thi core
   ngu vinh vien: khong log, khong FAIL, mo phong dung im.
2. Them INJECT_FAULT_DMA=1: cat ngan luot DMA ve 2 word. DMA van bao xong binh
   thuong, chi thieu du lieu -- de chung minh phase 6 doi chieu du lieu that.

## Ket qua

### Luot sach
--- DMA hoat dong binh thuong ---
[PHASE 6] MCHAN DMA, AXI hai chieu       ... OK
ket qua: phase6_dma() = 0

--- DMA khong bao xong (status ket) ---
[PHASE 6] MCHAN DMA, AXI hai chieu       ... FAIL  DMA L2->L1 khong bao xong sau 200000 lan poll, status=0xffffffff
ket qua: phase6_dma() = 1

### Luot tiem loi (INJECT_FAULT_DMA=1)
--- DMA hoat dong binh thuong ---
[PHASE 6] MCHAN DMA, AXI hai chieu       ... FAIL  word 254 sau khu hoi = 0x00000000, goc 0xa00000fe
ket qua: phase6_dma() = 1

--- DMA khong bao xong (status ket) ---
[PHASE 6] MCHAN DMA, AXI hai chieu       ... FAIL  DMA L2->L1 khong bao xong sau 200000 lan poll, status=0xffffffff
ket qua: phase6_dma() = 1

## Doc ket qua
Ba ket cuc phan biet duoc:
  DMA chay dung, du lieu dung        -> OK
  DMA chay dung, du lieu thieu       -> FAIL tai word 254 (= DEMO_L2_WORDS-2)
  DMA khong bao xong                 -> FAIL kem status, KHONG treo

Truoc thay doi nay, truong hop thu ba la mot vu treo im lang.
